# The maintainer's LOCAL working docs — not part of the public repo:
#   internal/features/  — per-feature requirements/design/tasks (the deep working notes)
#   internal/product/   — product vision, roadmap, research, brainstorming
# The public record is the topical design docs (docs/design/), the guarantees register
# (docs/product/constraints.md), the fail-safe doctrine and the UserGuide.
internal/

